          "from": "Sanskrit फल phala 'fruit'",
          "to": "फळ phaḷ /pʰəɭ/ 'fruit'",
          "note": "Intervocalic single -l- of Old Indo-Aryan surfaces as the retroflex lateral ळ."
        },
        {
          "from": "Sanskrit काल kālá 'time'",
          "to": "काळ /kaɭ̆/"
